ferrosintesis — third-party attribution notices
===============================================

The ferrosintesis SOURCE CODE is licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE-MIT and
LICENSE-APACHE). This file covers something different: the EMBEDDED SOUND RECORDINGS.

A build with default features (`embedded-samples`) compiles twenty-one first-party
sample-asset crates into the binary. Eleven are CC0 1.0 and require nothing. The ten
below are not, and their licences require that credit travel with any distribution —
including a binary.

IF YOU DISTRIBUTE A BINARY BUILT WITH DEFAULT FEATURES, YOU MUST REPRODUCE THE TEN
NOTICES LISTED HERE. Each asset crate packages its own NOTICE file carrying the exact
required text; concatenating those ten satisfies every obligation below. This file is
the index, not a replacement for them.

To build without any of this, disable default features — the fully modeled synth needs
no samples at all.

